  "details": "This was reported by Dargon in the VRC Discord when attempting to rejoin worlds in Local Test.\n\nIf you open QM -> Worlds and then click on Current World, nothing happens.\n\nHowever, double-clicking on the \"Here\" icon at the bottom of the QM will take you to the same UI page that the Current World button normally would.\n\nSo this seems like a UI inconsistency. Either both of these should work, or neither of them should work.",
